WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.834
Chief Justice

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:01.801
John Roberts

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:02.802
has told the chairman

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.404
of the Senate Judiciary Committee

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:06.473
he won't testify before an upcoming

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.675
hearing on Supreme Court ethics.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.677
That invitation to testify coming amid

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.145
growing scrutiny

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:13.847
about the ethical conduct

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:14.748
of the justices.

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:15.882
CNN's Brian Todd

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:17.684
is digging into all of this.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.752
Brian, tell us more.

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:19.486
Right, Wolf,

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:20.620
that information on Justice

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.354
Roberts coming

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.490
now that we have new information

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.592
on a case that Harlan Crowe,

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:26.659
that mega-donor,

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:27.527
did have at least

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:27.961
a company

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:28.762
relating to Crowe

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:30.697
did have before the Supreme Court

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:31.831
a case that Justice

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:32.632
Clarence Thomas

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:35.869
did not recuse himself from

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:37.203
recently.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.272
Supreme Court Justice Clarence Thomas

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:40.507
declared in a statement

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:41.174
that his dear

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:42.842
friend, Republican mega-donor

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:43.843
Harlan Crowe,

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:46.112
did not have business before the court

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:47.781
But tonight, CNN has learned

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:49.249
that's not true.

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:51.117
CNN's Arianna Devoe reports

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:52.752
a company related to Crowe

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:53.686
did have business

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.755
before the court in the mid to thousands

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.190
and just as Thomas didn't

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:58.925
recuse himself from the case.

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:00.660
There really was

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.896
a direct conflict of interest,

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.064
and it just makes the whole thing

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.298
a whole lot worse.

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:07.834
Records show that in January 2005,

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:08.568
a dispute

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.602
over a copyrighted

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.171
architectural drawing appeared

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:12.705
before the Supreme Court.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:14.140
One of the disputing parties,

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.942
a company called Metric Holdings

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:17.544
Limited Partnership.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:18.878
While Harlan Crowe's name

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:21.147
does not appear on a caption of the case,

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.015
a disclosure

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:23.216
statement says the corporate

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:24.717
parent of Metric Holdings

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:26.986
is Trammell Crow Residential Company.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.955
A statement from Crowe's office

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:31.057
says the Crowe family at the time

00:01:31.057 --> 00:01:32.659
had a non-controlling interest

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:34.861
in the Trammell Crow residential company.

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:35.862
The statement says

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:37.130
at the time of the case,

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:37.564
Trammell

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:39.032
Crow Residential operated

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:41.434
completely independently of Crow Holdings

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:42.268
and, quote,

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:43.570
Neither Harlan Crow

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:44.971
nor Crow Holdings

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:45.805
had knowledge of

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.640
or involvement in this case.

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:48.875
And Harlan Crow

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:50.210
has never discussed this

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:52.545
or any other case with the justice.

00:01:52.545 --> 00:01:53.913
Also, the Supreme Court

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:56.015
declined to hear the case at the time.

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:56.983
Still, one

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:59.686
watchdog group is concerned when you have

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.087
an entity

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.522
that is connected to this person

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:03.823
who's given all sorts of favors

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:05.125
to justice, Thomas.

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:05.725
By the time

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:07.026
we're getting into

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:08.528
wholly owned subsidiaries

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:09.195
and exactly

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:10.597
who has a controlling interest

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:11.264
and who doesn't.

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:14.801
We're way past

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.670
the kinds of issues that create real

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.539
appearances, real problems

00:02:19.539 --> 00:02:20.440
that the American people

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:21.508
would be concerned about.

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:23.476
Recent reports by the investigative news

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:24.611
outlet ProPublica

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:26.012
revealed that Justice Thomas

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:26.613
and his wife

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:27.714
Ginny accepted

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:29.115
luxury travel and gifts

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:31.217
from Harlan Crow for decades

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:33.253
and that in 2014,

00:02:33.253 --> 00:02:35.155
Thomas sold three of his family's

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:37.023
Georgia properties to Crow.

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:38.358
Thomas didn't disclose

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:39.392
the real estate deal

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:41.361
and most of the travel in filings.

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:43.129
Thomas responded that he was advised

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:45.031
he didn't have to report the travel,

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:46.032
but a source believes

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:47.300
he will amend his filings

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:48.735
in the real estate deal.

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:49.702
Also tonight,

00:02:49.702 --> 00:02:51.037
word of another potential

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:52.038
conflict of interest

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.540
with this beleaguered court.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:56.976
Politico and CNN report that in 2017

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:58.411
a Colorado property

00:02:58.411 --> 00:03:00.613
then co-owned by newly sworn in Justice

00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:01.748
Neil Gorsuch,

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:03.783
was sold for nearly $2 million

00:03:03.917 --> 00:03:05.251
to the CEO of prominent

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:07.387
law firm Greenberg Traurig,

00:03:07.387 --> 00:03:09.122
a firm that had numerous cases

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:10.023
before the court,

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:11.491
including at least one

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:11.758
where

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:12.692
Gorsuch sided

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:13.893
with a ruling in favor

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:15.495
of the firm's client.

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:15.962
Records

00:03:15.962 --> 00:03:17.530
show Gorsuch disclose

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:19.766
the sale of that property in filings,

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:21.501
but the section listing the buyer

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:22.535
was left blank

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:24.037
Neither the

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:24.904
Supreme Court nor

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:26.873
representatives for the firm Greenberg

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:28.274
Traurig have responded

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:29.943
to CNN's request for comment

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:32.011
on this reporting on Justice Gorsuch.

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:33.213
The CEO of that firm

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.914
who bought Gorsuch's property,

00:03:34.914 --> 00:03:35.882
well, he told Politico

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:37.684
he's never argued any cases before.

00:03:37.684 --> 00:03:38.551
Gorsuch

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:39.419
Clarence Thomas,

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:41.020
through a Supreme Court spokesperson,

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.388
declined to comment on CNN's

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:43.623
latest reporting on him.

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:44.657
And as we've just reported,

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:46.125
Chief Justice John Roberts

00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:46.859
signaling no

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:48.528
interest, telling Senator Dick Durbin

00:03:48.528 --> 00:03:50.330
he will not testify

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.331
before the Senate

00:03:51.331 --> 00:03:52.198
and doesn't look like he's

00:03:52.198 --> 00:03:54.200
going to investigate any of this Wolf.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.668
All right. Brian Todd reporting for us.

00:03:55.668 --> 00:03:56.936
Thank you very, very much.

